cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "DYF: Density Yields Features"
authors:
  - family-names: Donaldson
    given-names: Justin
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0009-9207-961X"
version: "0.4.0"
date-released: "2025-01-01"
license: MIT
url: "https://dyf.io"
repository-code: "https://github.com/jdonaldson/dyf"
abstract: >
  DYF discovers structure in embedding spaces using density-based
  locality-sensitive hashing. It classifies items as dense (core),
  bridge (transitional), or orphan (unique) and provides tools for
  hierarchical tree construction, bridge-aware retrieval, re-ranking,
  and ontology building.
keywords:
  - embeddings
  - density classification
  - locality-sensitive hashing
  - information retrieval
  - machine learning
